          },
          "committer": {
            "name": "GitHub",
            "email": "noreply@github.com",
            "date": "2020-12-04T16:52:21Z"
          },
          "message": "Fix Stamp param propagation from base image (#1672)\n\nThe Stamp attribute is now properly prorivded from the base image to the\r\nchild image which ensures that target image will be created with default\r\ntimestamp value.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncontainer_image(\r\n    name = \"with_stamped_creation_time\",\r\n    base = \":base_with_volume\",\r\n    stamp = True,\r\n)\r\n\r\ncontainer_image(\r\n    name = \"with_base_stamped_image\",\r\n    base = \":with_stamped_creation_time\",\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\nRelated to #155",
          "tree": {
            "sha": "0b7c71b7be9eb8107297473cd6c2ba3d0333bfbd",
            "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/rules_docker/git/trees/0b7c71b7be9eb8107297473cd6c2ba3d0333bfbd"
          },
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/discord/rules_docker/git/commits/02ad0a48fac9afb644908a634e8b2139c5e84670",
          "comment_count": 0,
          "verification": {
            "verified": true,
            "reason": "valid",
            "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJfymlFCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAAdHIIAJueu5H0+Gjn1EPeiEI/kgGk\nOxRbQtxisAeAtIO2CW4DG47ZcTQloS4MSWeSqHAfxAM9jgGupt80LU+9JBnc+bwP\nIwQ4NjEdiXOCld20dpSAt/HmjcSyoun8bcuQLe1ww0ErmfX5/SMMjhfvAs1J3+hX\nGNXgdZkzUOWep1XcwU1inlG/gXBkEgGmUCdH5r41jRLCYcrsIOqaEFe03uxQwuSf\n3iX8SvFqJ+Uj0MkRYmeiC9n4T+XyBQu+l/J24ZFow1XLSNSdjuUJZVb3VpHWyg/r\nWpW1QBtk73Zm95jKn+80jyBzNAoJ9KlLwHfvHqR/r1RrgM/a8j+Z8NmsTledLmM=\n=EROg\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
            "payload": "tree 0b7c71b7be9eb8107297473cd6c2ba3d0333bfbd\nparent c85e7b6cd5f812081bbfe44fb657ce89ffebfcc3\nauthor Miroslav Genov <mgenov@gmail.com> 1607100741 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1607100741 -0500\n\nFix Stamp param propagation from base image (#1672)\n\nThe Stamp attribute is now properly prorivded from the base image to the\r\nchild image which ensures that target image will be created with default\r\ntimestamp value.\r\n\r\n```\r\ncontainer_image(\r\n    name = \"with_stamped_creation_time\",\r\n    base = \":base_with_volume\",\r\n    stamp = True,\r\n)\r\n\r\ncontainer_image(\r\n    name = \"with_base_stamped_image\",\r\n    base = \":with_stamped_creation_time\",\r\n)\r\n```\r\n\r\nRelated to #155"
          }
